    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heterosexual man who avoids women due to deep-seated discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn order to solve the declining birthrate, let\u2019s help men like him overcome their fear of women.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That reckless idea gave birth to the latest android model\u2014Alice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a newly assigned staff member, is given his first mission:<br>to test her functions\u2014specifically, a \u201ccontact test.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how cute she looks, she's just a machine. There's no way this plan will work.<br>\u2014Or so he thought at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as they grow closer, something begins to stir in his heart.<br>\u201cThis can\u2019t be happening. She\u2019s just an android.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man who simply wants to live a quiet, \u201cnormal\u201d life.<br>An innocent, cheerful android girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will their unlikely love story lead...?</p>",
